---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Photography
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<p>
  I travel around the states whenever I can, and try to take time to go and explore other countries whenever I'm there for a conference. While I am not a great photographer, and only take photos with my phone, I have collected some good ones over the years.
</p>

{#- Albums come from _data/photos.js, newest (by latest photo) first. -#}
{% for album in photos %}
<hr>
<section class="album" id="{{ album.slug }}">
  <header class="album-header">
    <h2><a class="post-title" href="#{{ album.slug }}">{{ album.title }}</a></h2>
    <p class="album-date">{{ album.dates }}</p>
    {% if album.description %}<p>{{ album.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>

  <div class="gallery">
    {% for photo in album.photos %}
    <figure class="gallery-item" style="--ar: {{ photo.aspectRatio }}">
      <a href="{{ photo.fullUrl }}" title="{{ photo.date }}">{{ photo.html | safe }}</a>
      {% if photo.caption %}<figcaption>{{ photo.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
    </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}
